        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. Upon written request by AFSCME, the University will provide the undisclosed home addresses to a mutually agreed-upon mailing service firm through which AFSCME can correspond with said individuals. The mailing service shall keep confidential the home address of the employees who have requested that the home information not be released. AFSCME will bear all costs associated with this service.",
            "block_bbox": [
                181,
                400,
