        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "6. The Union agrees to defend, indemnify and hold harmless the University of California (including its subdivisions and employees) from any claim, suit or liability of any nature arising from (a) a challenge to the validity of this Section P; or (b) any action of the Union taken pursuant to, or in violation of, this Section P. The Regents will give the Union prompt written notice of any claim, suit or liability which it contends is subject to this provision.",
            "block_bbox": [
